    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Benefits",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Helps remove plaque and daily buildup<br\/><\/li><li>Helps lift visible tartar gently and effectively<br\/><\/li><li>3D Oscillating Electric Toothbrush reaches where flat brushing can’t<br\/><\/li><li>Water-jet cleaning helps reach tight gaps and hidden corners<br\/><\/li><li>Leaves your mouth feeling fresher and cleane<strong>r<\/strong><\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Buy The Bundle?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Targets multiple layers of buildup<br\/><\/li><li>Water flosser clears debris for smoother cleaning<br\/><\/li><li>Brush boosts results before and after each session<br\/><\/li><li>Better value than buying separately<br\/><\/li><li>Complete at-home oral-care solution<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How To Use",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Step 1:<\/strong> Start by brushing your teeth with your preferred 5-in-1 toothbrush mode<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 2: <\/strong>Use the Water Flosser Pro to wash away plaque, buildup, and trapped food<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 3:<\/strong> Select your Ultrasonic Cleaner mode and carefully remove visible buildup<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 4: <\/strong>Rinse your mouth and clean each tool with water<br\/><br\/><strong>Step 5: <\/strong>Store everything safely for next use<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "3442c9b0-dbb6-4dd7-b615-9313ba45f523": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s Included",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>1× Water Flosser Pro<br\/><\/li><li>1× Oscillating 5-in-1 Electric Toothbrush<br\/><\/li><li>1× Ultrasonic Tooth Cleaner<br\/><\/li><li>3× Replaceable Brush Heads<br\/><\/li><li>4× Unique 360° Rotating Flosser Nozzles<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "4629f7ef-2bd9-46e7-a3d7-291adcdb936a": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I deep clean the Electric Toothbrush",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1) Remove the brush head.<\/p><p>2) Rinse the bottom of the brush head with warm water.<\/p><p>3) Rinse the metal shaft area with warm water.<\/p><p>4) Clean the bottom of the toothbrush handle with a damp cotton swab to remove any residue.<\/p><p>5) Wipe the entire surface of the handle with a wet cloth.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_X7rArB": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions for your Teeth Whitening Powder",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Wondering how you can get the most out of your PAP+ Teeth Whitening Powder?<\/p><p>There's two ways to using the Teeth Whitening Powder:<\/p><p>1) Start by applying your toothpaste, and then gently dip your toothbrush with the toothpaste into the PAP+ Powder.<\/p><p>2) Alternatively, you can use it as a prelude to your daily brushing routine. Simply dip your toothbrush into the powder, brush your teeth vigorously for 2 minutes, and then proceed with your regular brushing regimen.<\/p><p>Recommended usage time: 3x per week<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use the electric dental cleaning kit?",
            "icon": "washing",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Select your desired attachment based on your oral needs.<\/p><p>2. Turn on the device and alter between modes based on your cleaning needs.<\/p><p>3. Alter between heads if necessary.<\/p><p>4. Clean the device and the tip after use. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cons of not using an Ultra Sonic Tooth Cleaner",
            "icon": "star",
            "row_content": "<p>Bad dental hygiene can be devastating on teeth and gums. Not only can it be expensive, but it can also lead to bad breath, gum disease, receding gums, dental decay, and even tooth loss.<\/p><p>This product may also be reffered to as one of the following:<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Calculus remover, Dental irrigator, Dental scaler, Oral irrigator, Plaque remover, Tartar removal tool, Tartar remover, Tooth cleaner, Tooth stain remover, Ultrasonic dental cleaner, Ultrasonic scaler, Ultrasonic tooth cleaner.<\/em><\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "b156cbed-7093-4197-84e3-0ced68818bea": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p><\/p><p>Please note this product is suitable for children over 6 years of age and under the age of 60.<\/p><p>If you have or had oral or gum surgery in the last 2 months please do not use this product unless approved by your dentist.<\/p><p>If your gums bleed heavily after using the Electric Toothbrush, please discontinue use and consult your dentist. <\/p><p>This product is strictly designed for oral care (cleaning teeth, gums and tongue) please do not use for other purposes. If you feel any discomfort or pain, please consult your dentist.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
